<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-29T17:01:06.689Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:01:06 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have struck Yemen's Aden airport and launched a ballistic missile toward Saudi Arabia's Ras Tanura refinery, while Saudi-led coalition aircraft have bombed a market in northern Yemen and a petrol station, causing civilian casualties. Saudi civil defense intercepted a Houthi missile over the Eastern Province and the coalition reported intercepting additional missiles. Aden airport has reopened after the Houthi attack, and the coalition continues airstrikes that killed 12 people in a residential area. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxNRE5GdUd5OWVlSXlJcU5fbkt4ZjZVbDBsRV8yYm1zSFBCNDRvSTJISzlXaU9xeTNxcC1kMzc1SlNneXRkaUJLQ1E5VUctYkstQXM3R3RHeld4Q0daS0N2MVc5VVBramhRMFoxVlk0WTNobEZyX0FkcUR6SmtQSlN1Rm5UamM2Y3ZzN3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOSlpYejlRTmd1MFprTGxzTHhIQi1taDhJVkMtTThYN1Y5UktONWZxcVM5TEJ2Sy1Jd25QZXFCem5uNDkzOGU3Z0NONzE1V0ZPT2E2QlJTdjZreDg0eXA5Z21MandpYmI3azQ5Q0h4azVTdHpYQnVQVGdYR3pEajBid0QtT0taZl9OVktOSUhIWjl6eGdqYlJ5RFZOd3p1LVRkVjVCVg?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOdDdEUHEyWktZdTJrQW8xV0NzNTFfSFlOME1Vck1ZSDVNZnIyVFZZcU5mTEV1MlJiRjR1OWgyZ19oZ3k5VXFlelhOa1YtVGlFdUpMSXNHYThpLVVuX0FUWElKUndhZnhldkZtRGdtQzM2VHQ1QXdfRkNPQ09TNnZBUG8xWXJoOUtFbFo4SFRRNXM0MnE2ZXJjTXE5MklDcVhBTjhVUmg0U2pvRFdiTUVBVjZSby1aQmk1T1pZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQZ2FTRW5XX3hPOWo2VDBPc1ZfdHB6clpUamI5amlfWXB3enZCall6NGxrbHZ1Q1RkU3ZkODBZNXJ2d2tNLUFPaFM0UW1JMTliZ3Jxb2Z2NHhaM1VwQlAtU1kzU1JhNUQ1TnhWT0IwOUxwVFVhaWhzSFhMQ0t